  <item>
    <title>EP04 对谈14岁的U：青春期的倦怠、孤立、积极、敏感及钝感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669776af8fcadceb90ef8e2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669776af8fcadceb90ef8e2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2024 07:45:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们通过访谈读一读“青春期”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与我对谈的是我的大女儿：U姐。U姐今年14岁，9月份就是8年级的学生了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔱 时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 什么让U姐完成了情绪的反转，并且还有点享受与其中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 《教育的迷思》里所说的“同伴影响力”，U姐验证了一把</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 青春期居然会“倦怠”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 因为敏感所以钝感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 青春期的孤独与孤立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 最大的收获是要“积极主动”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 再说“孤立”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> “完成比完美更重要”之做作业版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1411">23:31</a> U姐理解的“完美主义者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 性格到底是天生的还是后天养成的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> 每个个体都是独立的</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的BGM均为目前U姐最喜欢的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. あれくん,有彩 - ホワイトノイズ</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. もさを。 - ぎゅっと。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. Daydream——《营业悖论》特别纪念曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤓</span></p><span></span><p><span>窦老也是珺姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjM8tKPl8gSYxyy8wZnpzVoBsFw.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loFgx4V1ODN6H0YCCDCG1Z_6LEWz.m4a" length="32970740" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqroTV022E4dJWull41sEGxUw_KH.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP03 《终身成长》| TED 1500万+播放量：我们可以更加聪明、更加幸福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668fdc8b37236c546e783cc8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668fdc8b37236c546e783cc8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 13:22:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>“我不会将世界两分成弱和强，或者成功和失败……</span><br><span>我会将世界分成好学者和不好学者。” &nbsp;-Benjamin Barber</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqlP3uxpcqd3n8yRe357vX2Yxpze.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📚 《终身成长》【美】Carol Dweck</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔱 时间戳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 两则故事，感性认识“成长型思维模式”与“固定型思维模式”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 何为成长型思维？何为固定型思维？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 智商到底是不是天生的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 我们是在何时以及如何形成了这两种思维？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 亲密关系，我们可以更加幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 立志打破自己的“冷暴力”模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 亲子关系，我们可以一起成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 你觉得自己是固定型还是成长型？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 你相信人可以改变吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 如何一点点从固定型转换为成长型？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>接受现实</span></strong><span>：真实是改变的基础</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>观察、觉察</span></strong><span>：固定型思维模式何时被触发，以及它是如何影响你的行为和决策的。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>命名</span></strong><span>：我的冰冻宝贝</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>教育</span></strong><span>：与你的固定型思维进行对话</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>设定目标</span></strong><span>：与其内耗，不如开始行动</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>采取行动</span></strong><span>：有行动，就是进步</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>持续学习</span></strong><span>：阅读、上课、与他人探讨</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>培养习惯</span></strong><span>：日常生活中有许多练习的机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>寻求反馈</span></strong><span>：主动寻求来自他人的反馈，并将其视为成长和改进的机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>帮助他人</span></strong><span>：成为一个有影响力的人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 为自己寻找一个支持团体</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站上Carol Dweck教授的演讲</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411j76f/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=f7630692f0b43f93a2452722e06c7975" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411j76f/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=f7630692f0b43f93a2452722e06c7975"><span>www.bilibili.com</span><em><span>id</span></em><span>from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=f7630692f0b43f93a2452722e06c7975</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🤓</span></p><span></span><p><span>窦老也是珺姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIlLI0uSInpDbWWnDfWbMyTTWbj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Opening： 星茶会</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ending：夏星夜</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhgpVDD8vUxovhPhYlYPRwbl49vW.m4a" length="32926497" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqroTV022E4dJWull41sEGxUw_KH.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
